      "code": "if(line->indent < ctx->code_indent_offset  &&\n           md_is_container_mark(ctx, line->indent, off, &off, &container))",
      "note": "For the parser-visible one-byte line, indentation analysis yields `line->indent == 0`, so `md_analyze_line()` takes the new-container path and dispatches to `md_is_container_mark()` before any later line-type checks.",
